sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Authorized User
    participant W as Web
    participant A as API / Export Module
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as BullMQ
    participant X as Export Worker
    participant S as ObjectStorageProvider

    U->>W: Request XLSX/CSV export
    W->>A: Create export request
    A->>A: RBAC + object-scope authorization
    A->>D: TX: export_request + outbox
    D-->>A: Commit
    A-->>W: Accepted / export_id
    Q->>X: Export job
    X->>D: Read authorized server-side data in pages/stream
    X->>X: Generate XLSX/CSV
    X->>S: Store artifact if required
    S-->>X: Object reference
    X->>D: Mark completed + metadata + outbox
    W->>A: Download request
    A->>A: Re-authorize scope
    A-->>W: Download/stream result
